  "title": "Jean&#39;s Homemade Chicken Noodle Soup",
  "description": "Fresh ginger root gives extra zest to this otherwise standard chicken noodle recipe. This soup can be prepared in less than a half hour, and is great comfort food, especially during cold season.",
  "authors": [
    "Jean Wu"
